  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "文王四乳，仁愛篤厚。子畜十男，無有夭折。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:27272bba02ffdf8ae22b6c159721c116216f7449295b95fc369bed8dacc7f502",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b509c3849664fad10871da02bce6af385cdbec82972942df2ce056733a11bd03"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "下堂出門，東西九山。逢福值喜，得其安閒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7681c724e850cc1cc6405d5aea7bb4784280e054e09d1b8e0dee2f9d3e53e0e3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:48e22041991ad515498f969af55bd3bb6f9f9f5f6e352cfce6a966498b880c58"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "城上有烏，自鳴破家。招呼醜毒，為國災患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3eb62e7fef87957e99715f8d5e0810223d2657aeaecbbb8ee81ecd73b910b4e5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:103e3247ef1d6230e5da7ea19baa8c4eeff4eb865207375eede856f355ed4631"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "伯虎仲熊，德義淵泓。使布五穀，陰陽順序。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e5e43849107474b981f16be4d4a905d17e41d7eef46b82bbb50ee36141b77111",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:451555d87c471f835bbf6fbdf640a68d6c99804e10e9c08c455dd59520f47caa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "飲酒醉臥，跳起爭鬥。伯傷仲僵，東家治喪。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e4bfc79f1ff845feba0ba51561f8feecede629652b954747410623f2deb9155e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d8dff596ff8c15a6b9ecb782eb0d405009d6293a7832694649eafc3e67c40735"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "四目相視，稍近同執。日映之後，見吾伯姨。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8e5c3c9e1d2ad586c1fa8463bbd81615a07733fe0ffca1e59fc2816d5e7d7c2c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8a49fba008872ed57adb2cbbb2af948d8bf449f07d97b12418262703d55f5ab1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "隨時逐便，不失利門。靈獲得福，富於封君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:654455c3e349ea5c1edfa29a21d3e6d87f58f58a96f408bd90f753573f11acc4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aac75e03a14bf68adfb89bb28485602795a25fb57b7d8ccdae57f1c56dd6d41f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "隴西冀北，多見駿馬。去如焱，害不能傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f37363e9aea7ebc0a4b6534092a30ed8cfa61b294082c586d732601482b67fb9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:39a194f53a8872620fa35b12154966ed8ddd5cfbc644dc985a16e2dfe2fb0f3e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "白龍黑虎，起伏俱怒。期戰盤空，蚩尤敗走。死於魚首。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:359cbe643d71d237f0db0a9364a4d93c0fff653423ba78a76fccc55a63a9fb41",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:16acea236a6b4027dcfdc124acb42020545d385dc14965128afe813d949c13c8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "鴻飛戾天，避害紫淵。雖有鋒門，不能危身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2aa9f86b8aebaa0d859a3c2018aa887261a82024c120af132ef347fbd13544d7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0a9b588900f7c257bfc84892242bc04685e81bd64c575905c161ba4f6b16bd4c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "平國不均，夏氏作亂。烏號竊發，靈公隕命。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7e3e34dfcec7e83010834f331e66e1fdd8ec9e6d82d3f5fbe19d3bd45c30b540",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1bc13d1e7a092feaa8ac1f33047f83b8ae4c0e3b3034b4b0706bfd48ae6642ec"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "江漢上遊，政逆民憂。陰伐其陽，雄者受殃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:566e43a7bc08c0008b02bfc7889790d99628b7fb96fbd79870cfbe1fed452011",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e454bd45baf23a5e7d2b5fcb6749b5155c824f7616eb29ca07a39ca4b2323ad3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "東家殺豬，聞臭腥臊。神怒不顧，命絕衰國。亳社火燒，宋公夷誅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6f3a0e04a537316a68e7636a02455e8fc6bcad646236c30668764020dce5aad6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:abf677bec4111d0be01ea6cb2f0ec4d447bd2cf165ddb34b32b009c844676c5b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "西誅不服，恃彊負力。倍道趍敵，師走敗覆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:13020f827ec44e89ef91a496a607f548f111eb3d7d66b6e31985f3772cad67a8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:29b10ea9087296ee1624d1da018abf63a57c1d96f466b7f69becca3de3f8cd23"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "一婦六夫，擾亂不治。張王季莊，莫適為公。政道塞壅，周君失邦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5645a84d72197689efb52b1630c9df4d5919a59a69d1705618982be3ea35579b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e7b9ba40bb9e769781ce70a783611c859a45a3cf359cd63f91779bd382ca67b5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "配合相迎，利之四鄉。昏以為期，明星煌煌。欣喜奭懌，所言得當。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:969384f37d4eb7e3c00aae01755fff9bc2896b18cea6b2d0f970ac8fdcd19f17",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7d06578bdc7060146f8763a500ad9285e104c2de0d74ed4c85778b4cce1e57e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "猿墜高木，不踒手足。握金懷玉，還歸其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:47e7d362df1d3998a1e7ae1f2e3087b54559583c8a979d0642a461fc739080de",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e1fe805666a820d4ec582bed04281e1c4d408f2127b816c9b60dd688502ece9c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "卷領遁世，仁德不害。三聖攸同，周國茂興。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:80af8cb62a45a1cc06612f1a10679769f42f0c7503f255865333631705426f8f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1ddd27a372c8cd7ee7f76df58cd56a8c618b9947320c0af1e1ff9f08dd5d4e5c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "去危脫厄，安無怵惕。上福善堂，見我喜悅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dd2d8f92b913c42c00986ae9d7cbb9c761a98904857f55826be8421a8ad3f475",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6dfe704c945969e4fbbd47b11ee18279b0d245d6f658bec9e34617856f695a2c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "帶季兒良，時利權兵。將師合戰，敵不能當。趙魏以彊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6aeb21bc8c421f981c337278e3dd6ad2c7861beeebb546bd693af5ee31b32f1c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:594340c50bd3584a70522774a9822df40f48987f763b6c90986ce7c0c2e31ed5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "鵠思其雄，欲隨鳳東。順理兩翼，出自日中。須留北邑，復反其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c39cab801f2852a8a6fe49514c39eab105ce72d96c41047eb99ce3b95e57559e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a829ee66a772851dd30f7c19e5878868e88fa2f0c2dc8561cdeaeb5a5168ad23"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "且如驚鹿，不能定足。室家分散，各走竄匿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9165204599833ed81eddc5d355307bdbfaf2ed38ed2168133d852f935957a3fa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6a8a74dcd7a5d7df87b17ffed75f186766c8a068971fe62f6143270ca2fcfcd8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "甲乙丙丁，俱歸我庭。三丑六子，入門見母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:70b021f5c9b30dc4b4dd82c7a6b8b4901586e0a9576c57cf592d90c25593dfbd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4062859e12daf3a14ee667aa0ca447bca53a3736d1f75fc8bf649c0742dfeeaa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "躡華巔，觀浮雲。風不搖，雨不薄。心安吉，患無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:249d464a54afdb599c7bd870e87523ee706a6e9fce1bc7d4e72424d266f89ffa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:037a313db749ab51a20de3f2f9993b0174d57569df3a94cd5a657794dd7d6ae4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "德施流行，利之四鄉。雨師灑道，風伯逐殃。巡狩封禪，以告成功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:62b09ef745f662b380cd0c652c9474ae7e65179c6b3763e60b028d5d47e0feab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b220806cfee504b64803dbaa11768af4d643c83430004e0b408e26ece5d6cc18"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "水流趨下，遂成東海。求我所有，買鱣與鯉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eb39c8612a82561509ef42c04f29263573519bfbe5b960ce5af740c3aa778923",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a2e408cb26ba78399c26ee580ba7a512941490adac75c77d942a3c544f5240ab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "和氣相薄，膏潤津澤，生我嘉穀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:54b0766e27c58aad4fcf251960045ed2d091e166e17f1568d0d1a37f0312cd54",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c08c2052464cdb47746c0ebcbc359c8ee13050d1f2273e9edf19033a119ce425"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "憂驚以除，禍不成災，安全以來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5ec75e08b2bdf8860066a31a7b780e9ed6c9fcb1b9ba37d603b19fd353ac7225",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c17fdcf924da7aeae4613e29b8148a0cbbaf47cba591b72eb287bed58f01a798"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "堅冰黃鳥，常哀悲愁。不見甘粒，但睹藜蒿，數驚鷙鳥，為我心憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:81a883a95182fb2af07cb95b7928d4849b599235c08b18fdfe10a8750821eac0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:084f2609defa95ae98ab2c9159794ef68360fdd3a38fa22422fa4360c39064d8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "翕翕 ，實墜崩顛。滅其令名，身命不全。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:800b1dee368f49ed6059b7964715b83999b29be349eef7be03381d410ba3e84f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4a84e581f309ea9264f9bf933ec4080ed85c795329f29a30eccb95111809ab47"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "因禍受福，喜盈其身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:efa273fc85a129d2d7d08695fd36c0ae9a10230bbc1fc214a5f099d3d268e415",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3aa22e5bbb72bfa80c79c9fb90caa7133ad195d9fdca273686559df3b78678f4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "陸居千里，不見河海，無有魚市。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d6b165f2b78cc8e385de6de36e8aff0bc7eeafb5fd38bce2bf528fc2a6d85a58",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3199cc8fea2793edf77970a61724c36900676986f96e8208546ebf239732262c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "鹿得美草，鳴呼其友。九族和睦，不憂飢乏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0f1932debdda016072ce659c4c6e9f6eca70cd7e873c978caf17c547adc45003",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b385daa75aee3e07fe7635c31f4b49bc74026c7d1eb1ab6c0d69049b2dae2b74"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "出門得堂，不逢禍殃。入戶自苦，不見矛戟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a1232b7b8113e5bf872ac3bb060ade08fcf66247e299622802a8336b7f767734",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6c82f7c990df7715cc61facbec8817133b762e7dca1279c688ed33655ce9db0a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "累尊重席，命我家客。福祐久長，不見咎殃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:85d1ef4dcdbc3da084a7d80ffc4f5bb70f6efa08797970bdda222d429f25eac6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:75e32e5e75918d429dc099825a7371364dfb352a6a37e052fd2a81a60ef9c707"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "鴻雁俱飛，北就魚池。鱣鰋鯰鯉，眾鳥饒有。一鳴獲兩，得之過倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3ad067994b887877f7bc0c05b97ed1722a79f6080acff895493ee4cc4be831ab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:76f3ff3efdcca8ac150bca70cce1947a0a4b11847b8217ca56faecd19668a0e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "當風奮翼，與鳥飛北。入我家國，見吾慶室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:30c5cbb7317c7461f71aaadb41f7d9fe1ce6d13cd2d6ee569cb016edf69fae41",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5443586658622def771681fb36a734400c09c98d8c9f4acc781bbefdc4187e99"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "麒麟鳳凰，善政得祥。陰陽和調，國無災殃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cd0a4725c569d2a32ef91394eee6893cb5af829846c639554f5460c8d904e85e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f560265add2dc2fd57cb98b0ff06081e7122d18f8935109ec55a95aaadcedd45"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "逐狐東山，水過我前。深不可涉，失其後便。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f62380b142397a696e584c599142b4a241ecb8c95dc68b128aad40a0b6c8452",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f6b20da79590d8e510d068a3fd6bab738135d936f18e0586f17b8f5812c84737"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "丑戌亥子，飢饉所生。陰為暴客，水絕我食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1a28451225ff56ff75abce25c8645d9b225ddd0c9b057a1cd292c70efadbc010",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0fc11f07e434dd0788f7194d67351defab87af98dcc4b9ae535009aebb545e1b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "狐狸雉兔，畏我迯去。分走竄匿，不知處所。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:09e7a7e554abe68475e3f94d734baf8d55d83bbd3ebe8d072dbe2691c8e4337c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b586cce92d00e9cae203431dd28ed682da8900ca4450a734ac5ba63e6fdcc06c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "桀跖惡人，使得不通。炎旱為殃，年榖大傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5cb17f76b40e0bc3ca445801894f68ad11e339b44c82a468272ff72e32492f1e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6264fd618d31ff2990d6d72337e596a1d41a42f24a5ce40df37140739d28bc87"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "兔乳立室，行來雀食。虎攫我子，長號不已。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5c056469394d56ae06c36242ad2d9f2fe78232374ee786e23b2b7f95587b3532",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:54e4ca75aaedf2f9bfcec162abedf5e77d1b72be9a227dfe9bf3844784138d21"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "土階明堂，禮讓益興。雄雌相得，使我無疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e067f35769bd3d20d255dfd81578458bfa88539dd509026f69aa9436da30542f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:91997823d8fe87c58102b785e09a6e1974aaf0d8064913a351b17f956156c190"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "送金出門，井失玉兔。往來井上，破甕壞盆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b1da735190c2d73dc78a854d8432d0c9d78cb84935a0b7777e5f5196b1f7d029",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ba6e1712e9d6946de89fbd0d1b0f2970c7021c5c33ee5165f6360597e3d140e5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "諷德誦功，美周盛隆。加其旦輔，夬濟沖人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:06c455c3b6069adbcef4e43c292b9021bcf4af78926afa870ef593ae623e2be2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f0cb3f984c4b6810a4c30a1ca537e5a62991dfef1f309edc69e847fe35b270ec"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "盜竊滅身，二母不親。王后無黨，毀其寶靈。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:60a9c57dc608dba8c3610c8834b64ed3363f6235d12287b655befe7e2e38c9ec",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fc123593ed262b82aef0a2899a76c9f15417b826d21208b9420e76e7697a3b90"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "六月騤騤，名欲有至。專征未裝，俟侍明旦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3286b64e220c54abbe231ce950ba3a68447188d339b67fbc633af82606dcdbf8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c5e6383737b2ffd2c0015ac959dfb7f1e5275c081ce3ccdccbb8f35ac37aec54"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "雀行求粒，誤入網罭。賴仁君子，復說歸室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c72c428e8b9153d81e9022253e508cdd3391afafcefbdec70a624ba85f97c882",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7a5f5a555d29889473ec5cb11258b795a60fdebdc78d031560d47f63e8496294"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "仁德孔明，患禍不傷。期誓不至，室人御恤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7e451bcdcd0af0ae6fd0b5422582c8e8c130a5c7869e9eeefe906fb503f0cf03",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c2ba8accf61d875344a99a203f9bf1be10104bc79d64b42690c00dc8ff69607a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "龜厭江海，陸行不止。自今枯槁，失其都市。憂悔咎生。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3ce970a42b197da2a254bc2f8003e74609c2e40a6faf88fc66e1b25e3faae317",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9b054f476b6e7baa27368c20f32f7b190c7451141ab5245a2b3cadf3373eb57a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "孤獨特處，莫依為輔。正心允濟，神勞志苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fcbdefa46b730306cd42e7a830c9474152612e37f850f2a1293c7f0644121919",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e7bd8c9d513359f70bbfccf3bb60f59983a9ab698cf85f61a3e9d15727a63dda"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "伯仲言留，叔子云去。誰云無咎，主母大喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7384530bf56a6add12430846911c8555a8880ce79ee981e3c7f7b74078a290d7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f2116353d69a106f13798eeff09af3b87348ed0cdbc45b01bc23713b5460f0a6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "初憂不安，後得笑懽，雖懼無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9c6aebb1551f8b20cdfb5ddee272c3ece1dfe42272092a4e47e0382add5936b7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6e968c118296ba05836f87102dd615dbe794ffe3707c8e14f7c0a6a6fdbacc9e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "好戰亡國，師不以律。稱上殞墜，齊疾狼戾。被其災祟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:066b5c57c76cbb3b97a72c6c025c01f64c1627388d3e4e77229e32f989a965c1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:99d2a4227095dfb3a342c83d79e4fe8cde8b154c6468a4ebd36ba4df2aa1bdf7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "鹿生澤陂，豺傷其麑，泣血獨哀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eec39e6444e0c0f6f420e27614cbb6c6cb56b2c1b2437f40eaa20b640ba5165a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:35d3ac742b9c57961b4e7ff4f0e9e496d71cdb823acc2faacefca0d5cb81e737"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "天地鈐塞，仁智隱伏。商旅不行，利潤難得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:be809de623f67cd5a53a1d496e1071e9f3925a7608bce410ad8e1e443ec187cc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1f6ba088d856b70ee67634c213adb841425a65789719692acf98b0e289196d0f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "福德之士，歡悅日喜。夷吾相桓，三歸為臣。賞流子孫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d5600fff113285d827266c501f89653115c5852ea550838a373b43de738f61eb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d2f41bd3c3fe90da80c952c72245c0cc71c8122788374bde726a652863ab3df3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "上無飛鳥，下無走獸。擾亂未治，勞民於事。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d16540d20bee1241fd20ba483cfb8d57d61ead3383cee7939f9477ad244ab592",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:585c367558d9ca290a120837e16555b739c2f19d4d01a9a0a50037c7600f9fa9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "月削日衰，工夫下機。宇宙滅明，不見三光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6389e8fdd28bb20ff286fb358d369144f2d072c08cb016aa887f1b3085c0d07b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4f06c007fed0aacbfb02ddc9abff22e3acfca6295955c256837d22801192b1bf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "戴盆望天，不見星辰。顧小失大，福迯牆外。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8f02883947f84475ca3d3f0f92830da79334d2601e2c75b363249767dfa6c77c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4ad9cb29a4dd3a9bbb05a07bd94e0d6467644e4b96d636b8ec2f8955b4599fb6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "握斗運樞，順天無憂。所行造德，與樂並居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f7bd61b2ed8b12d632c70b07c70ab599306c439563246be90234603acbdbf6c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9926e3e9f718ffb697a0fb3a9972ac7e859ecc63131efa18ffbde848e9a87dcf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "操戟刺魚，披髮立憂。虎脫我輿，狼取我袍。亡馬失財。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:93d2561a4e1dc7b23e18899fa23b009671b7fee76d0a7e709a531d9753fbccfb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a3028f0892cd17f3c46ed42a446cecc7ba654111597cdde729ac763a86ff995d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 42,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "兩人俱醉，相與悖戾。心乖不同，爭訟匈匈。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7f2431b2406f1e8dfea6dd97ec5e18030f30624f0f7bd48505020d91f751eaa9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ca8595d4de4ab73ad7d202bde81d2c3531caed4dde1deebfb2627aa63fc65f68"
    }
  ]
}
